A standalone run of 1, 5, 9, ... spaces is negative after a line break
(including a written-out \\n). The single-space response is nearly absent
inside a line. Tab-plus-space indentation and nonbreaking spaces have
smaller, separate rules. Double backticks following nonbreaking-space
indentation are also negative. Other text is left near zero.
