"""Sparse approximation using local spelling, number and syntax cues.

Positive triggers include short/kurz/kort fragments, 'shortly', 'thirty',
and the second digit of 30/31. English month dates and clock times amplify
the numeric response. A document-opening // newline is especially strong.
