"""A lexical approximation for access, ownership, and C++ library syntax.

A strong positive response marks access-label colons.  Lesser responses mark
C++ types and library operations, and several words for shared, exclusive,
private, or specialized things.  Header suffixes and streams are negative.
Everything else is zero.  A bounded byte tail handles split Unicode characters;
the language hint and tail both reset at document boundaries.
