"""Line-boundary response, weakened on indented lines and list continuations.

Actual line breaks give a positive response, modified by indentation, blank
lines, adjacent punctuation, and chat delimiters. Escaped newlines give a
smaller response. A document-initial Title: field has a separate negative
response. End-of-text and tab tokens have boundary-specific rules.
Ordinary text is approximated by zero; lexical variation is omitted.
